{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Generators.Temporal</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Time zone data","href":"#time-zone-data","children":[]},{"title":"Options","href":"#options","children":[]},{"title":"Values","href":"#values","children":[]},{"title":"Zone sources","href":"#zone-sources","children":[]},{"title":"Generators","href":"#generators","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Date and time generators.</p><p>Generate dates, times, instants, UTC offsets, time zones, durations and calendar spans.</p><p>Values are records or variants in <a href=\"Date/index.html\"><code>Date</code></a>, <a href=\"Time/index.html\"><code>Time</code></a>, <a href=\"Datetime/index.html\"><code>Datetime</code></a>, <a href=\"Instant/index.html\"><code>Instant</code></a>, <a href=\"Offset/index.html\"><code>Offset</code></a>, <a href=\"Zoned_datetime/index.html\"><code>Zoned_datetime</code></a>, <a href=\"Duration/index.html\"><code>Duration</code></a> and <a href=\"Span/index.html\"><code>Span</code></a>. Time zones are strings. Each value module provides formatting, comparison and a default generator for <code>[@@deriving hegel_generator]</code>. Use <a href=\"../index.html#val-map\"><code>map</code></a> to convert values for a date library.</p><p>All temporal generators are printable. Failure output uses the <code>to_string</code> representation without quotes or escapes, including inside lists and other compound values.</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>  let%hegel_test weekend_dates tc =\u000A    let d =\u000A      draw\u000A        tc\u000A        (Temporal.dates\u000A           ~min_value:{ year = 2024; month = 1; day = 1 }\u000A           ~weekdays:[ `Saturday; `Sunday ]\u000A           ())\u000A    in\u000A    assert (d.year &gt;= 2024)\u000A  ;;</code></pre>","content":"<h3 id=\"time-zone-data\"><a href=\"#time-zone-data\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Time zone data</h3><p>Draws and queries use Hegel's bundled IANA time zone database by default; <a href=\"#val-tzdb_version\"><code>tzdb_version</code></a> returns its version. Use <a href=\"#val-set_default_zone_source\"><code>set_default_zone_source</code></a> to change the process default, or pass <code>source</code> to <a href=\"#val-zones\"><code>zones</code></a> or <a href=\"#val-zoned_datetimes\"><code>zoned_datetimes</code></a>.</p><p><a href=\"Zone_source/index.html\"><code>Zone_source</code></a> lets you use the same database as the code under test. It accepts TZif files, structured zone data, lookup callbacks and lazy loaders. <a href=\"#val-resolve\"><code>resolve</code></a>, <a href=\"#val-offset_at\"><code>offset_at</code></a> and <a href=\"#val-info\"><code>info</code></a> query a source outside a test.</p><h3 id=\"options\"><a href=\"#options\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Options</h3><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-precision\"><a href=\"#type-precision\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> precision</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-precision.Nanoseconds\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-precision.Nanoseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Nanoseconds</span></code></li><li id=\"type-precision.Microseconds\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-precision.Microseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Microseconds</span></code></li><li id=\"type-precision.Milliseconds\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-precision.Milliseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Milliseconds</span></code></li><li id=\"type-precision.Seconds\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-precision.Seconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Seconds</span></code></li><li id=\"type-precision.Minutes\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-precision.Minutes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Minutes</span></code></li><li id=\"type-precision.Hours\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-precision.Hours\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Hours</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The unit used to generate and shrink the time component of a value. Values are whole multiples of this unit.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-granularity\"><a href=\"#type-granularity\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> granularity</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-granularity.Hours\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-granularity.Hours\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Hours</span></code></li><li id=\"type-granularity.Quarter_hours\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-granularity.Quarter_hours\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Quarter_hours</span></code></li><li id=\"type-granularity.Minutes\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-granularity.Minutes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Minutes</span></code></li><li id=\"type-granularity.Seconds\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-granularity.Seconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Seconds</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Allowed offset increments: whole hours, quarter hours, minutes or seconds.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-weekday\"><a href=\"#type-weekday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> weekday</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-weekday.Monday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Monday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Monday</span></code></li><li id=\"type-weekday.Tuesday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Tuesday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Tuesday</span></code></li><li id=\"type-weekday.Wednesday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Wednesday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Wednesday</span></code></li><li id=\"type-weekday.Thursday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Thursday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Thursday</span></code></li><li id=\"type-weekday.Friday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Friday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Friday</span></code></li><li id=\"type-weekday.Saturday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Saturday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Saturday</span></code></li><li id=\"type-weekday.Sunday\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-weekday.Sunday\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Sunday</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A day of the week.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-month\"><a href=\"#type-month\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> month</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-month.January\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.January\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`January</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.February\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.February\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`February</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.March\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.March\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`March</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.April\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.April\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`April</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.May\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.May\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`May</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.June\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.June\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`June</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.July\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.July\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`July</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.August\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.August\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`August</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.September\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.September\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`September</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.October\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.October\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`October</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.November\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.November\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`November</span></code></li><li id=\"type-month.December\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-month.December\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`December</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A month of the year.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-ambiguous\"><a href=\"#type-ambiguous\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> ambiguous</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-ambiguous.Both\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-ambiguous.Both\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Both</span></code></li><li id=\"type-ambiguous.Earlier\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-ambiguous.Earlier\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Earlier</span></code></li><li id=\"type-ambiguous.Later\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-ambiguous.Later\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Later</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>How to resolve a repeated wall time. <code>`Both</code> draws either instant and shrinks toward the earlier one. <code>`Earlier</code> and <code>`Later</code> always select the earlier or later instant, respectively.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-sign\"><a href=\"#type-sign\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> sign</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-sign.Uniform\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-sign.Uniform\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Uniform</span></code></li><li id=\"type-sign.Mixed\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-sign.Mixed\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Mixed</span></code></li><li id=\"type-sign.Non_negative\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-sign.Non_negative\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Non_negative</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>`Uniform</code> draws one sign for all span units, <code>`Mixed</code> draws each sign independently, and <code>`Non_negative</code> draws only nonnegative values.</p></div></div><h3 id=\"values\"><a href=\"#values\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Values</h3><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-unknown_zone\"><a href=\"#val-unknown_zone\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> unknown_zone : string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>&quot;Etc/Unknown&quot;</code>, the zone whose instants are known and whose offset is not.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Date\"><a href=\"#module-Date\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Date/index.html\">Date</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Calendar dates.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Time\"><a href=\"#module-Time\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Time/index.html\">Time</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Times of day.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Datetime\"><a href=\"#module-Datetime\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Datetime/index.html\">Datetime</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Wall-clock dates and times.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Instant\"><a href=\"#module-Instant\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Instant/index.html\">Instant</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Instants.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Offset\"><a href=\"#module-Offset\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Offset/index.html\">Offset</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>UTC offsets.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Zoned_datetime\"><a href=\"#module-Zoned_datetime\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Zoned_datetime/index.html\">Zoned_datetime</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Wall-clock times in a time zone.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Duration\"><a href=\"#module-Duration\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Duration/index.html\">Duration</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Signed durations.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Span\"><a href=\"#module-Span\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Span/index.html\">Span</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Calendar spans.</p></div></div><h3 id=\"zone-sources\"><a href=\"#zone-sources\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Zone sources</h3><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Zone_source\"><a href=\"#module-Zone_source\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Zone_source/index.html\">Zone_source</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Time zone data for generators and queries.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-default_zone_source\"><a href=\"#val-default_zone_source\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> default_zone_source : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>default_zone_source ()</code> is the process-wide default zone source: the one <a href=\"#val-zones\"><code>zones</code></a>, <a href=\"#val-zoned_datetimes\"><code>zoned_datetimes</code></a> and the queries use when given no <code>source</code>. It is <a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#val-bundled\"><code>Zone_source.bundled</code></a> until <a href=\"#val-set_default_zone_source\"><code>set_default_zone_source</code></a> sets another.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-set_default_zone_source\"><a href=\"#val-set_default_zone_source\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> set_default_zone_source : <span><a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>set_default_zone_source source</code> makes <code>source</code> the process-wide default and returns the previous default, so that a caller can restore it. Generators keep the default from when they were created. Set it before creating generators that should use it. Queries use the current default on each call.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-tzdb_version\"><a href=\"#val-tzdb_version\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> tzdb_version : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>tzdb_version ()</code> is the IANA release of the time zone database bundled with Hegel, such as <code>&quot;2026e&quot;</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Zone_info\"><a href=\"#module-Zone_info\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Zone_info/index.html\">Zone_info</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>What a zone source knows about a time zone name; see <a href=\"#val-info\"><code>info</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Zone_offset\"><a href=\"#module-Zone_offset\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Zone_offset/index.html\">Zone_offset</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The offset a zone has in force at an instant; see <a href=\"#val-offset_at\"><code>offset_at</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-info\"><a href=\"#val-info\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> info : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?source</span>:<a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"Zone_info/index.html#type-t\">Zone_info.t</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>info ?source name</code> returns metadata for an exact zone name, or <code>None</code> if unknown. <code>source</code> defaults to <a href=\"#val-default_zone_source\"><code>default_zone_source</code></a>. <a href=\"#val-unknown_zone\"><code>unknown_zone</code></a> has itself as primary name, the tag <code>Undefined</code> and the highest rank. Names absent from the bundled database use the source's link target and tags, and rank after bundled names. Raises <code>Usage_error</code> if loading fails.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-resolve\"><a href=\"#val-resolve\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> resolve : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?source</span>:<a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"Zoned_datetime/index.html#type-t\">Zoned_datetime.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>resolve ?source name civil</code> classifies and resolves <code>civil</code> in zone <code>name</code>, using <code>source</code> (default <a href=\"#val-default_zone_source\"><code>default_zone_source</code></a>). For a repeated wall time, it selects the earlier instant (<code>fold</code> false). Raises <code>Usage_error</code> if the zone is unknown or cannot be loaded, <code>civil</code> is invalid, or the result is outside <a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\"><code>Instant.t</code></a>'s range.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-offset_at\"><a href=\"#val-offset_at\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> offset_at : <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?source</span>:<a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"Zone_offset/index.html#type-t\">Zone_offset.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>offset_at ?source name instant</code> returns the offset in zone <code>name</code> at <code>instant</code>, using <code>source</code> (default <a href=\"#val-default_zone_source\"><code>default_zone_source</code></a>). Raises <code>Usage_error</code> if the zone is unknown or cannot be loaded, or <code>instant</code> is invalid.</p></div></div><h3 id=\"generators\"><a href=\"#generators\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Generators</h3><p>All bounds are inclusive. Invalid or inverted bounds, ranges with no value at the requested precision, empty weekday lists and unknown zone names raise <code>Usage_error</code> on every draw.</p><p>Invalid fields, mixing wall-clock and instant bounds, or passing <code>source</code> to <a href=\"#val-zoned_datetimes\"><code>zoned_datetimes</code></a> alongside a <a href=\"#val-zones\"><code>zones</code></a> generator can also raise <code>Usage_error</code> when creating the generator.</p><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-dates\"><a href=\"#val-dates\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> dates : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:<a href=\"Date/index.html#type-t\">Date.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:<a href=\"Date/index.html#type-t\">Date.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?weekdays</span>:<span><a href=\"#type-weekday\">weekday</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?months</span>:<span><a href=\"#type-month\">month</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Date/index.html#type-t\">Date.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>dates ?min_value ?max_value ?weekdays ?months ()</code> generates dates in <code>[min_value, max_value]</code> (default: <a href=\"Date/index.html#val-min_value\"><code>Date.min_value</code></a> to <a href=\"Date/index.html#val-max_value\"><code>Date.max_value</code></a>) on the given <code>weekdays</code> and in the given <code>months</code> (default: all). Empty <code>weekdays</code> or <code>months</code> lists are errors. Shrinks toward 2000-01-01 or the nearest bound, with extra sampling of boundaries and dates such as leap days.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-times\"><a href=\"#val-times\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> times : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:<a href=\"Time/index.html#type-t\">Time.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:<a href=\"Time/index.html#type-t\">Time.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?precision</span>:<a href=\"#type-precision\">precision</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Time/index.html#type-t\">Time.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>times ?min_value ?max_value ?precision ()</code> generates times of day in <code>[min_value, max_value]</code> (default: the whole day), a whole number of <code>precision</code> units (default <code>`Nanoseconds</code>) since midnight. Shrinks toward midnight or the lower bound.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-datetimes\"><a href=\"#val-datetimes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> datetimes : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:<a href=\"Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:<a href=\"Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?precision</span>:<a href=\"#type-precision\">precision</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>datetimes ?min_value ?max_value ?precision ()</code> generates naive datetimes in <code>[min_value, max_value]</code> (default: <a href=\"Datetime/index.html#val-min_value\"><code>Datetime.min_value</code></a> to <a href=\"Datetime/index.html#val-max_value\"><code>Datetime.max_value</code></a>) whose time of day is a whole number of <code>precision</code> units (default <code>`Nanoseconds</code>). Shrinks toward 2000-01-01T00:00:00 or the nearest bound.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-instants\"><a href=\"#val-instants\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> instants : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:<a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:<a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?precision</span>:<a href=\"#type-precision\">precision</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>instants ?min_value ?max_value ?precision ()</code> generates instants in <code>[min_value, max_value]</code> (default: <a href=\"Instant/index.html#val-min_value\"><code>Instant.min_value</code></a> to <a href=\"Instant/index.html#val-max_value\"><code>Instant.max_value</code></a>), a whole number of <code>precision</code> units (default <code>`Nanoseconds</code>) since the epoch. Shrinks toward 2000-01-01T00:00:00Z or the nearest bound, with extra sampling of epoch, integer, leap second and time zone transition boundaries.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-offsets\"><a href=\"#val-offsets\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> offsets : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?granularity</span>:<a href=\"#type-granularity\">granularity</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?allow_unknown</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Offset/index.html#type-t\">Offset.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>offsets ?min_value ?max_value ?granularity ?allow_unknown ()</code> generates UTC offsets between <code>min_value</code> and <code>max_value</code> seconds east of UTC (default <code>±</code><a href=\"Offset/index.html#val-max_seconds\"><code>Offset.max_seconds</code></a>) that are a whole number of <code>granularity</code> units (default <code>`Seconds</code>). <code>allow_unknown</code> (default <code>false</code>) also permits the unknown offset. Shrinks to a known offset, then toward <code>+00:00</code>, with extra sampling of historical offsets.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-zones\"><a href=\"#val-zones\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> zones : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?names</span>:<span>string list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?allow_links</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?allow_legacy</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?allow_unknown</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?allow_opaque</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?source</span>:<a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(string, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>zones ?names ?allow_links ?allow_legacy ?allow_unknown ?allow_opaque ?source ()</code> generates zone names from <code>source</code>, which defaults to <a href=\"#val-default_zone_source\"><code>default_zone_source</code></a> at construction.</p><p>Without <code>names</code>, draws from the source's names. <code>allow_links</code> (default <code>true</code>) includes aliases such as <code>Asia/Calcutta</code>; <code>allow_legacy</code> (default <code>false</code>) includes names such as <code>EST5EDT</code> and <code>US/Eastern</code>. With <code>names</code>, draws only those exact names and ignores both flags.</p><p><code>allow_unknown</code> (default <code>false</code>) adds <a href=\"#val-unknown_zone\"><code>unknown_zone</code></a>. <code>allow_opaque</code> (default <code>false</code>) accepts entries in <code>names</code> that are absent from the source, treating them like <a href=\"#val-unknown_zone\"><code>unknown_zone</code></a>. Otherwise, unknown names raise <code>Usage_error</code>, as does an empty set of eligible names.</p><p>Shrinks toward simpler zones, ending at <code>UTC</code> when allowed.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-zoned_datetimes\"><a href=\"#val-zoned_datetimes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> zoned_datetimes : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?zones</span>:<span><span>(string, <span class=\"type-var\">'p</span>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?source</span>:<a href=\"Zone_source/index.html#type-t\">Zone_source.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:<a href=\"Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:<a href=\"Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_instant</span>:<a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_instant</span>:<a href=\"Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?precision</span>:<a href=\"#type-precision\">precision</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?allow_imaginary</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?ambiguous</span>:<a href=\"#type-ambiguous\">ambiguous</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Zoned_datetime/index.html#type-t\">Zoned_datetime.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>zoned_datetimes ?zones ?source ?min_value ?max_value ?min_instant ?max_instant ?precision ?allow_imaginary ?ambiguous ()</code> generates a zoned wall-clock time, selecting an instant if the time is repeated.</p><ul><li>Without <code>zones</code>, uses <code>zones ~source ()</code>.</li><li>A generator returned directly by <a href=\"#val-zones\"><code>zones</code></a> supplies both names and source. Pass <code>source</code> to <a href=\"#val-zones\"><code>zones</code></a>; passing it here too raises <code>Usage_error</code>.</li><li>Any other generator, including <a href=\"../index.html#val-filter\"><code>filter</code></a>, <a href=\"../index.html#val-map\"><code>map</code></a>, <a href=\"../index.html#val-one_of\"><code>one_of</code></a> or <a href=\"../index.html#val-sampled_from\"><code>sampled_from</code></a>, uses <code>source</code> for the generated names. Unknown names raise <code>Usage_error</code>; opaque zones require <code>zones ~allow_opaque:true</code>. If the zone has no wall time within the bounds, the test case is rejected.</li></ul><p><code>source</code> defaults to <a href=\"#val-default_zone_source\"><code>default_zone_source</code></a> at construction.</p><p>Pass <code>~source:s</code> again when wrapping <code>zones ~source:s ()</code>: <code>zoned_datetimes ~zones:(filter keep (zones ~source:s ())) ~source:s ()</code>.</p><p>Use wall-clock bounds (<code>min_value</code> / <code>max_value</code>, default <a href=\"Datetime/index.html#val-min_value\"><code>Datetime.min_value</code></a> to <a href=\"Datetime/index.html#val-max_value\"><code>Datetime.max_value</code></a>) or instant bounds (<code>min_instant</code> / <code>max_instant</code>). Mixing them raises <code>Usage_error</code>. Wall times are whole multiples of <code>precision</code> (default <code>`Nanoseconds</code>) since midnight.</p><p><code>allow_imaginary</code> (default <code>true</code>) permits skipped wall times, reported as <code>Gap</code>. Set it to <code>false</code> to exclude gaps. <code>ambiguous</code> (default <code>`Both</code>) selects the instant for a repeated wall time.</p><p>Shrinks toward simpler zones, then toward 2000-01-01T00:00, preferring a unique wall time to a repeated one. Extra sampling around transitions covers gaps, folds and transition boundaries.</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>  let new_york =\u000A    Temporal.zoned_datetimes\u000A      ~zones:(Temporal.zones ~names:[ &quot;America/New_York&quot; ] ())\u000A      ~precision:`Seconds\u000A      ~allow_imaginary:false\u000A      ()\u000A  ;;\u000A\u000A  let%hegel_test never_in_a_gap tc =\u000A    let z = draw tc new_york in\u000A    match z.kind with\u000A    | Unique | Fold -&gt; ()\u000A    | Gap -&gt; assert false\u000A  ;;</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-durations\"><a href=\"#val-durations\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> durations : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?min_value</span>:<a href=\"Duration/index.html#type-t\">Duration.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?max_value</span>:<a href=\"Duration/index.html#type-t\">Duration.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?precision</span>:<a href=\"#type-precision\">precision</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Duration/index.html#type-t\">Duration.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>durations ?min_value ?max_value ?precision ()</code> generates signed durations in <code>[min_value, max_value]</code> (default: <a href=\"Duration/index.html#val-min_value\"><code>Duration.min_value</code></a> to <a href=\"Duration/index.html#val-max_value\"><code>Duration.max_value</code></a>), a whole number of <code>precision</code> units (default <code>`Nanoseconds</code>). Shrinks toward zero, with extra sampling of bounds and durations such as one unit or 24 hours.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-spans\"><a href=\"#val-spans\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> spans : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?years</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?months</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?weeks</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?days</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?hours</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?minutes</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?seconds</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?milliseconds</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?microseconds</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?nanoseconds</span>:<span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?sign</span>:<a href=\"#type-sign\">sign</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"Span/index.html#type-t\">Span.t</a>, <a href=\"../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>spans ?years ?months ?weeks ?days ?hours ?minutes ?seconds ?milliseconds ?microseconds ?nanoseconds ?sign ()</code> generates calendar spans. Each specified unit uses inclusive <code>(min, max)</code> bounds; unspecified units are 0. If no units are specified, all use <code>±max_int</code>, or <code>[0, max_int]</code> with <code>`Non_negative</code>. <code>sign</code> defaults to <code>`Uniform</code>. Shrinks toward zero. Inverted bounds or bounds incompatible with <code>sign</code> raise <code>Usage_error</code>.</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>  let%hegel_test short_spans tc =\u000A    let s = draw tc (Temporal.spans ~days:(0, 30) ~hours:(0, 23) ()) in\u000A    assert (s.days &lt;= 30 &amp;&amp; s.years = 0)\u000A  ;;</code></pre></div></div>"}